  "description": "Ju Sung-Hyeon has it all: the looks, the grades, and a flawless reputation. But his fast track to a golden future hits a massive speed bump when his family drags him to a middle-of-nowhere village. The uniforms are tacky, the locals are worse, and to top it all off, someone else is sitting in his throne as the school’s top student! Enter Park Chan-Woo, a born-and-bred country boy who doesn’t care about Sung-Hyeon’s city prestige. But when Sung-Hyeon confronts his new rival to reclaim his pride, Chan-Woo offers a deal he never expected: \"If you want to talk, help me with the harvest first.\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
